      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Westmont%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Westmont sits on heights rising up to 700 feet above the Stonycreek and Conemaugh River valleys.",
