      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Westmont%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Johnstown Inclined Plane was built to provide easy travel between the city and the ridge where Westmont is located.",
